<font color="#808080">(ڕەنگدان)</font>

1449
01:37:11.800 --> 01:37:13.325
<font color="#808080">(SCREAMING)</font>

1450
01:37:13.480 --> 01:37:15.482
شاشا!

1451
01:37:18.520 --> 01:37:21.126
<font color="#808080">(DEBRIS CLATTERING)</font>

1452
01:37:22.840 --> 01:37:24.569
